<section class="section promise" id="promise">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head-row">
      <div class="rv">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--yellow)">Our difference</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 12px">Two things every driver needs.<br /><em>One accountant who does both.</em></h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lanes">
      <div class="rv lane">
        <span class="tag">Lower bills</span>
        <h3>We <u>minimise</u> your tax</h3>
        <p>We claim every allowable expense, get your figures right the first time, and keep you the right side of HMRC. Realistic fees, no surprises.</p>
        <div class="glow"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv lane">
        <span class="tag">More support</span>
        <h3>We <u>maximise</u> your benefits</h3>
        <p>We're the accountant that also checks your entitlement to Universal Credit, PIP, ESA and Housing Benefit, then helps you claim and appeal.</p>
        <div class="glow"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rv first-note">First accountancy practice in Northern Ireland to help clients claim Universal Credit.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .promise {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .promise h2 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .promise h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .lanes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 38px;
  }

  .lane {
    background: #1b1916;
    border: 1px solid #2b2823;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 30px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lane .tag {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #0e0d0c;
    background: var(--yellow);
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .lane h3 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 18px 0 10px;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .lane h3 u {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .lane p {
    color: #c3bdb1;
    font-weight: 500;
    position: relative;
  }

  .lane .glow {
    position: absolute;
    right: -30px;
    bottom: -30px;
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 196, 0, 0.14), transparent 70%);
  }

  .first-note {
    margin-top: 26px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    color: #e8e3d7;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--yellow);
    padding-left: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .lanes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
